# purpose: the account lifecycle - open, frozen, open again, closed.
# exercises: FREEZE / UNFREEZE / CLOSE; account-frozen; account-closed (even for BALANCE);
#            non-zero-balance; BALANCE is allowed on a frozen account; a closed id cannot be re-opened.
OPEN alice USD
DEPOSIT alice 20
FREEZE alice
DEPOSIT alice 5
WITHDRAW alice 5
BALANCE alice
UNFREEZE alice
WITHDRAW alice 20
CLOSE alice
DEPOSIT alice 1
BALANCE alice
OPEN alice USD
OPEN bob EUR
DEPOSIT bob 1
CLOSE bob
WITHDRAW bob 1
CLOSE bob
BALANCE bob
